<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-954] &quot;Unpredictable&quot; have to be represented by NaN on DF.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-954</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On our RandomForest src, we uses &quot;-1&quot; for representing &quot;Unpredictable&quot;,&lt;br/&gt;
but for regression problem, there is a case which outputs &quot;-1&quot; for the correct result.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For resolving this problem, we should change the unpredictable flag to &quot;NaN&quot; from &quot;-1&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12539604">MAHOUT-954</key>
            <summary>&quot;Unpredictable&quot; have to be represented by NaN on DF.</summary>
